  "description": {
    "en": "The Lacoste L23 Light is a lightweight collaboration racquet developed with Tecnifibre, designed to deliver comfort, forgiveness and easy maneuverability. Weighing 275 g unstrung with a 320 mm balance and 16x19 string pattern, it is particularly suitable for beginner and intermediate players seeking effortless handling and controllable power. Its variable-density string pattern is tighter around the ideal hitting zone and more open toward the edges, helping combine tolerance, comfort and power.",

    "zh": "Lacoste L23 Light 是 Lacoste 与 Tecnifibre 联合开发的轻量化联名球拍，主打舒适性、容错率与灵活操控。球拍采用275克空拍重量、320毫米平衡点及16×19线床，非常适合初学者和中级球员。其线床在核心甜区位置密度更高，而边缘区域更加开放，从而兼顾精准度、容错性与力量输出。整体风格轻盈、易打，并兼具 Lacoste 标志性的设计感。"
  },

